━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do event-own-machine
    - owner Pointer
    - stop EventMachineStop

` Keeps what stops a machine a property of an object holds, which the object's `close` runs
` (`event-stop-machines`).
. sidecar = event-sidecar(owner)
if !sidecar.machine-stops
    sidecar.machine-stops = List'EventMachineStop()
sidecar.machine-stops! += stop

━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━
+ do event-stop-machines
    - owner Pointer

` Stops each machine the properties of an object hold, the last started first, and once: each
` exits its active cases, running their `do finally`, and drops what it subscribed. Then the
` object's events close, so that no transition on them, which the class's table may run, fires
` after.
. sidecar = gc-object-side-payload'EventSidecar(owner, events-lane())
=? if !sidecar
. stops = sidecar.machine-stops
=? if !stops
sidecar.machine-stops = null
while stops.length != 0
    . stop = stops.pop()
    stop()
sidecar.close()

