+ is-resolving = false

_ next Index = 0

╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌ is EventMachineLane ╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌╌

────────────────────
+ do run-next ?! Error

. dispatch = dispatches[next]
next += 1
if next == dispatches.length
    dispatches.clear()
    next = 0
is-resolving = true
dispatch()
    catch error Error
        unhandled-error(error)
is-resolving = false
for lane in resolved
    lane.run-next()
        catch error Error
            unhandled-error(error)
resolved.clear()

